        "name": "Deckard Cain"
      }
    ],
    "explanation": "Johanna pairs extremely well with Heroes that can follow up her slow but powerful engage with any kind of area of effect Ability to deal burst damage to enemy Heroes and/or to crowd control them.\n\nDue to her weak engage when her Heroic Ability is not available, Johanna greatly benefits from Heroes that can help her with that in the 4-man (such as Maiev) and/or from the offlane (for example Leoric with Entomb at Level 10)."
  },
  "counters": {
    "heroes": [
      {
        "id": "varian",
        "name": "Varian"
      },
      {
        "id": "leoric",
        "name": "Leoric"
      },
      {
        "id": "hanzo",
        "name": "Hanzo"
      },
      {
        "id": "zeratul",
        "name": "Zeratul"
      }
    ],
    "explanation": "Johanna can be countered by constantly depleting her Health with sustain damage, targeting her while Iron Skin is on cooldown, or using high-mobility Heroes to target her backline.\n\nVarian, due to Shattering Throw at Level 13, can completely destroy Johanna's main defensive tools: Iron Skin baseline and either Indestructible or Blinded By The Light at Level 20."
  },
