    "explanation": "Johanna performs better on medium-sized Battlegrounds that favor early-game rotations with tons of waveclear (such as Tomb of the Spider Queen) or on Battlegrounds where it is easy to reach the late game (for example Warhead Junction). On the other hand, she is lackluster on most 2-lane Maps as well as Maps with wide empty areas (such as Hanamura Temple)."
