    {
      "name": "Basic Attacks Build",
      "label": "Situational",
      "description": "Johanna's Basic Attacks Build allows you to crowd control enemy Heroes more often in the late game while also having a respectable amount of additional survivability.\n\nYou can play this Build when you want more self-sustain in the early game, thanks to Laws of Hope at Level 1, and when you want more crowd control later on, thanks to either Blessed Momentum's cooldown reduction or Shrinking Vacuum's damage reduction at Level 16.\n\nWhen playing against Heroes with a lot of raw healing (notably Whitemane), you should consider picking Sins Exposed at Level 7, especially if your team lacks powerful healing reduction effects.\n\nWhen playing as Offlaner and having to double soak, to avoid Mana problems, you should pick Eternal Retaliation at Level 4 and only use Condemn for clearing Minions.",
